<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>復盤日誌 | 終極交易系統</title>
    <style>
        :root { --bg-color: #0f172a; --panel-bg: #1e293b; --text-main: #f8fafc; --text-muted: #94a3b8; --accent-green: #10b981; --accent-red: #ef4444; --accent-blue: #3b82f6; --accent-yellow: #f59e0b; --border-color: #334155; --warning-bg: #7f1d1d; --warning-border: #f87171; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: var(--bg-color); color: var(--text-main); padding: 20px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
        
        /* 頂部導航列 */
        header { margin-bottom: 30px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-color); padding-bottom: 15px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .nav-btn { background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--accent-green); color: var(--accent-green); padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; transition: 0.2s; }
        .nav-btn:hover { background: var(--accent-green); color: white; }

        /* 警報提示區 */
        #global-warning { display: none; background-color: var(--warning-bg); border: 2px solid var(--warning-border); color: #fca5a5; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; animation: pulse 2s infinite; }
        @keyframes pulse { 0% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: 0.8; } 100% { opacity: 1; } }

        /* 儀表板 */
        .dashboard { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .card { background-color: var(--panel-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; }
        .card-title { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .card-value { font-size: 26px; font-weight: bold; }
        .pnl-positive { color: var(--accent-green); }
        .pnl-negative { color: var(--accent-red); }

        /* 歷史表格區 */
        .log-panel { background-color: var(--panel-bg); padding: 25px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); overflow-x: auto; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; }
        th, td { padding: 15px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
        th { color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: normal; }
        .status-open { color: var(--accent-yellow); font-weight: bold; border: 1px solid var(--accent-yellow); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; }
        .status-closed { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
        .action-btn { background-color: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); color: var(--text-main); padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 12px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; margin-right: 5px; font-weight: bold; }
        .action-btn.resolve { border-color: var(--accent-blue); color: var(--accent-blue); }
        .action-btn.resolve:hover { background-color: var(--accent-blue); color: white; }
        .action-btn.delete:hover { border-color: var(--accent-red); color: var(--accent-red); }

        /* 彈出視窗 (Modal) */
        .modal-overlay { display: none; position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.7); z-index: 1000; justify-content: center; align-items: center; }
        .modal-content { background: var(--panel-bg); width: 90%; max-width: 450px; padding: 25px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
        .modal-content label { display: block; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 15px;}
        .modal-content input, .modal-content textarea { width: 100%; padding: 12px; background-color: var(--bg-color); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); color: var(--text-main); border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px; }
        .modal-btns { display: flex; gap: 15px; margin-top: 25px; }
        .btn-primary { background-color: var(--accent-blue); color: white; border: none; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; flex: 1;}
        .btn-outline { background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); color: var(--text-main); padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; flex: 1;}
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <header>
        <h1>📋 交易紀錄與復盤日誌</h1>
        <a href="plan.html" class="nav-btn">✚ 新增開倉計畫 ➔</a>
    </header>

    <div id="global-warning">
        🚨 系統嚴重警告：你的歷史復盤中有單筆交易虧損 ≥ 10%！<br>
        「請暫停任何開倉動作，確認心態回穩，絕不報復性交易！」
    </div>

    <div class="dashboard">
        <div class="card"><div class="card-title">已平倉筆數</div><div class="card-value" id="total-trades">0</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="card-title">歷史勝率</div><div class="card-value" id="win-rate">0%</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="card-title">累計總收益</div><div class="card-value" id="total-pnl">$0.00</div></div>
        <div class="card"><div class="card-title">單筆最大虧損</div><div class="card-value" id="max-loss">0%</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="log-panel">
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>日期時間</th>
                    <th>狀態</th>
                    <th>標的 / 方向</th>
                    <th>計畫盈虧比</th>
                    <th>實際盈虧(%)</th>
                    <th>實際盈虧($)</th>
                    <th>事前理由 / 事後復盤</th>
                    <th>操作</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id="trade-body"></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="modal-overlay" id="close-modal">
    <div class="modal-content">
        <h2 style="font-size: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-bottom: 10px;">結算與事後復盤</h2>
        <input type="hidden" id="modal-id">
        <label>最終盈虧百分比 (%) - 虧損請填負數</label>
        <input type="number" id="modal-pct" step="any" placeholder="例如: 15.5 或 -10">
        
        <label>實際盈虧金額 (USD)</label>
        <input type="number" id="modal-amt" step="any" placeholder="例如: 150 或 -50">
        
        <label>事後檢討筆記 (誠實面對自己)</label>
        <textarea id="modal-notes" rows="4" placeholder="是否有遵守紀律？是被洗掉還是策略失效？..."></textarea>
        
        <div class="modal-btns">
            <button class="btn-outline" onclick="closeModal()">取消</button>
            <button class="btn-primary" onclick="submitClose()">確認平倉並寫入日誌</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
    let trades = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('trading_master')) || [];

    window.onload = function() { renderAll(); };

    function openModal(id) {
        document.getElementById('modal-id').value = id;
        document.getElementById('modal-pct').value = '';
        document.getElementById('modal-amt').value = '';
        document.getElementById('modal-notes').value = '';
        document.getElementById('close-modal').style.display = 'flex';
    }

    function closeModal() { document.getElementById('close-modal').style.display = 'none'; }

    function submitClose() {
        const id = parseInt(document.getElementById('modal-id').value);
        const pct = parseFloat(document.getElementById('modal-pct').value);
        const amt = parseFloat(document.getElementById('modal-amt').value);
        const notes = document.getElementById('modal-notes').value;

        if(isNaN(pct) || isNaN(amt)) return alert('請填寫有效的盈虧數值');

        const index = trades.findIndex(t => t.id === id);
        if(index > -1) {
            trades[index].status = 'Closed';
            trades[index].pnlPct = pct;
            trades[index].pnlAmt = amt;
            trades[index].notes = notes;
            saveData();
            closeModal();
        }
    }

    function deleteTrade(id) {
        if(confirm('確定要刪除這筆紀錄嗎？')) {
            trades = trades.filter(t => t.id !== id);
            saveData();
        }
    }

    function saveData() {
        localStorage.setItem('trading_master', JSON.stringify(trades));
        renderAll();
    }

    function renderAll() {
        const tbody = document.getElementById('trade-body');
        tbody.innerHTML = '';
        
        let closedTrades = trades.filter(t => t.status === 'Closed');

        trades.forEach(t => {
            const tr = document.createElement('tr');
            let pnlPctStr = t.status === 'Closed' ? `${t.pnlPct >= 0 ? '+' : ''}${t.pnlPct}%` : '-';
            let pnlAmtStr = t.status === 'Closed' ? `${t.pnlAmt >= 0 ? '+' : ''}$${t.pnlAmt}` : '-';
            
            let pnlClass = t.status === 'Closed' ? (t.pnlPct >= 0 ? 'pnl-positive' : 'pnl-negative') : '';
            let statusBadge = t.status === 'Open' ? '<span class="status-open">🟡 持倉中</span>' : '<span class="status-closed">已平倉</span>';
            
            let actionHtml = t.status === 'Open' 
                ? `<button class="action-btn resolve" onclick="openModal(${t.id})">平倉</button>`
                : `<button class="action-btn delete" onclick="deleteTrade(${t.id})">刪除</button>`;

            // 整合理由與復盤筆記的顯示
            let noteDisplay = t.status === 'Open' ? `[計畫] ${t.reason}` : `[復盤] ${t.notes || '無'}`;

            tr.innerHTML = `
                <td>${t.date}</td>
                <td>${statusBadge}</td>
                <td><strong style="font-size: 16px;">${t.symbol}</strong> <br><span class="${t.dir==='Long'?'pnl-positive':'pnl-negative'}">${t.dir==='Long'?'📈 多':'📉 空'}</span></td>
                <td>${t.rr !== '-' ? '1 : '+t.rr : '-'}</td>
                <td class="${pnlClass}" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;">${pnlPctStr}</td>
                <td class="${pnlClass}">${pnlAmtStr}</td>
                <td style="max-width: 250px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted);">${noteDisplay}</td>
                <td>${actionHtml}</td>
            `;
            tbody.appendChild(tr);
        });

        document.getElementById('total-trades').innerText = closedTrades.length;
        if(closedTrades.length > 0) {
            const wins = closedTrades.filter(t => t.pnlPct > 0).length;
            document.getElementById('win-rate').innerText = ((wins / closedTrades.length) * 100).toFixed(1) + '%';
            
            const total = closedTrades.reduce((sum, t) => sum + t.pnlAmt, 0);
            const pnlEl = document.getElementById('total-pnl');
            pnlEl.innerText = (total >= 0 ? '+' : '') + '$' + total.toFixed(2);
            pnlEl.className = 'card-value ' + (total >= 0 ? 'pnl-positive' : 'pnl-negative');

            const minPct = Math.min(...closedTrades.map(t => t.pnlPct));
            document.getElementById('max-loss').innerText = (minPct < 0 ? minPct : 0) + '%';
            
            document.getElementById('global-warning').style.display = minPct <= -10 ? 'block' : 'none';
        } else {
            document.getElementById('win-rate').innerText = '0%';
            document.getElementById('total-pnl').innerText = '$0.00';
            document.getElementById('total-pnl').className = 'card-value';
            document.getElementById('max-loss').innerText = '0%';
            document.getElementById('global-warning').style.display = 'none';
        }
    }
</script>

</body>
</html>
